WEBVTT

00:07.665 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

01:36.785 --> 01:38.905
ADAPTED FROM THE EARLY SPRING ON JJWXC.NET
AUTHOR: GU NIANG BIE KU

01:53.065 --> 01:54.105
Lumi.

01:54.985 --> 01:55.945
I want to work in this place.

01:59.505 --> 02:01.185
NORTHWESTERN CULTURAL TOURISM
DEVELOPMENT PROJECT, BUSINESS DIVISION ONE

02:03.105 --> 02:04.465
Northwestern China?

02:04.545 --> 02:06.145
That's so far away from here.

02:06.225 --> 02:09.545
And the project will run
for 14 months, not 14 days.

02:11.385 --> 02:13.625
I know. But I have made up my mind.

02:14.305 --> 02:15.505
Tracy told me that

02:15.585 --> 02:18.105
while I passed all the requirements,
I still needed a bit more.

02:18.625 --> 02:20.305
I have never managed
any S+ projects of highly importance.

02:20.385 --> 02:22.345
This is a great opportunity.

02:22.425 --> 02:23.505
It's all I need now.

02:30.545 --> 02:32.025
Same here.

02:40.065 --> 02:41.465
You have not given up yet?

02:42.625 --> 02:44.465
The boy is mine.

02:44.985 --> 02:46.305
He saved my life.

02:47.065 --> 02:49.705
It's only right for me to marry him.

02:50.305 --> 02:53.625
What? When did he save your life?

02:55.345 --> 02:57.985
My ex harassed me a while ago.

02:58.065 --> 02:59.385
We almost got physical.

02:59.465 --> 03:02.185
And he suddenly appeared to save me.

03:02.865 --> 03:06.025
He fought two enemies alone,
and he did not lose.

03:06.105 --> 03:10.385
So manly. He looks like a nerd,

03:10.465 --> 03:12.465
but how can he be
so handsome when he fights?

03:12.545 --> 03:15.105
His abs. His posture. I was like…

03:22.825 --> 03:23.905
Did he look at me?

03:25.025 --> 03:25.865
Did he look at me?

03:28.705 --> 03:29.945
He did.

03:47.105 --> 03:50.225
ANOTHER LEAP OF FAITH

03:59.225 --> 04:00.225
Come in.

04:03.425 --> 04:04.545
Luke.

04:06.185 --> 04:07.025
Take a seat.

04:13.265 --> 04:14.105
Luke.

04:16.705 --> 04:18.985
I would like to apply
to join the Northwestern

04:19.064 --> 04:21.145
Cultural Tourism
Development Project team next month.

04:23.705 --> 04:24.905
That is a tough subject.

04:25.505 --> 04:27.265
You only return here
for two days per month.

04:28.865 --> 04:29.945
Still, I want to join.

04:30.745 --> 04:31.625
Why?

04:33.305 --> 04:35.705
Because I believe we all have a value
and a place we need to be.

04:35.785 --> 04:37.865
Where there is a risk,
there is an opportunity too.

04:38.465 --> 04:40.865
I'm still young. I want to take the risk.

04:40.945 --> 04:43.585
I'm also aware
that given my average skills,

04:43.665 --> 04:45.545
I won't be able to pick up an S+ project

04:45.625 --> 04:47.665
unless it is very far away.

04:50.185 --> 04:53.305
Shang Zhitao, you won't admit this,

04:54.025 --> 04:55.265
but you are selling yourself short.

04:55.345 --> 04:57.785
You want to tread off the beaten path

04:59.185 --> 05:01.265
and hope it may lead to success.

05:03.105 --> 05:05.705
But someone has to make
the path first, right?

05:05.785 --> 05:09.385
No one wants to make this path, but I do.

05:10.145 --> 05:12.105
Luke. Can you approve it?

05:12.785 --> 05:14.465
This is also on my wishlist.

05:17.145 --> 05:19.145
I have a wishlist.

05:22.825 --> 05:25.145
I really want the expert title.

05:32.785 --> 05:33.625
Fine.

05:34.305 --> 05:35.145
As you wish.

05:37.105 --> 05:38.025
Okay.

05:38.105 --> 05:39.025
Thanks.

05:41.585 --> 05:42.705
What about Luke then?

05:49.385 --> 05:50.305
I haven't thought about it.

05:50.385 --> 05:51.665
When push comes to shove,
I'll bring him with me.

05:55.065 --> 05:56.265
You can let him live with me.

05:57.305 --> 05:58.825
He knows my place well anyway.

06:01.505 --> 06:02.865
I wouldn't want to trouble you,
But thanks.

06:26.985 --> 06:27.945
So…

06:29.545 --> 06:30.705
You broke up?

06:32.625 --> 06:33.505
I don't know.

06:36.185 --> 06:37.585
I guess so.

06:38.585 --> 06:42.385
He rejected me,
but I wasn't embarrassed or anything.

06:43.185 --> 06:44.385
And I do not resent him either.

06:45.225 --> 06:48.425
Now I've become an emotionless workaholic.

06:52.465 --> 06:54.305
Perhaps you didn't love him that much.

06:55.705 --> 06:56.865
Or perhaps

06:58.665 --> 07:00.785
a true heartbreak is always silent.

07:04.025 --> 07:05.665
Or perhaps…

07:10.865 --> 07:13.785
Or perhaps we have never fallen in love.

07:20.385 --> 07:22.865
Even though we were in a relationship,

07:25.025 --> 07:26.305
it was never real.

07:33.145 --> 07:34.425
I don't think it's gastric.

07:35.905 --> 07:37.705
I just feel a bit bloated.

07:39.145 --> 07:42.025
Wait. Are you still with that girl?

07:42.625 --> 07:44.785
Did you use protection?

07:45.545 --> 07:46.465
What are you saying?

07:47.145 --> 07:47.985
Just be frank.

07:48.065 --> 07:49.385
All right then.

07:49.465 --> 07:51.665
Did you contract any STDs?

07:53.465 --> 07:55.585
I'm about to be as chaste as a monk.

08:04.305 --> 08:06.305
SHANG ZHITAO

08:10.185 --> 08:11.225
Yes?

08:11.745 --> 08:16.065
Is Luke's rabies
vaccine certificate with you?

08:18.505 --> 08:20.625
Yes. I have it.

08:22.105 --> 08:24.305
But I'm sick now. I can't go out.

08:25.385 --> 08:26.345
Why don't you drop by my place?

08:27.465 --> 08:29.545
Get me some medicine.
I'll send the brand to you.

08:52.785 --> 08:53.785
Luke.

08:59.905 --> 09:00.785
Are you okay?

09:00.865 --> 09:02.985
Where does it hurt? You're in pain.

09:03.065 --> 09:04.385
Are you sure the medicine will help?

09:04.465 --> 09:05.505
Let's go to the hospital.

09:08.185 --> 09:09.665
I don't like hospitals.

09:16.505 --> 09:17.745
It hurts so much.

09:18.425 --> 09:19.545
I can't find the vaccine certificate.

09:23.705 --> 09:25.305
It's too late for you to get one anyway.

09:27.585 --> 09:31.105
I don't like to owe anyone a favor.
Given that you brought medicine for me,

09:32.905 --> 09:33.825
fine,

09:34.345 --> 09:35.545
I'll take care of Luke for you.

09:36.905 --> 09:39.465
You… You're sick,

09:39.545 --> 09:41.865
And I've already checked your schedule.

09:41.945 --> 09:43.905
You have a business trip next week.

09:44.945 --> 09:46.785
Your flatmates also have business trips.

09:47.625 --> 09:49.425
Besides, my neighborhood
has a dedicated dog sitter.

10:03.065 --> 10:05.665
NORTHWESTERN CHINA

10:05.745 --> 10:06.785
Sun Yuanzhu.

10:07.865 --> 10:09.865
You have lost a lot of weight.

10:09.945 --> 10:11.905
Is the food here that bad?

10:13.505 --> 10:15.145
No, it's good.

10:15.225 --> 10:16.985
I have been busy, that's all.

10:18.265 --> 10:19.705
Then, I shouldn't have
asked you to pick me up.

10:19.785 --> 10:21.105
No way.

10:21.905 --> 10:24.385
Tao. I'm so happy that you're here.

10:25.665 --> 10:29.025
Following your footsteps,
I have come here to achieve my ambition.

10:29.105 --> 10:34.025
I, Ms. Shang Zhitao,
will be working with the local councils

10:34.625 --> 10:37.385
as the project director of Lime.

10:37.465 --> 10:42.145
I will combine the local culture
and digital technology

10:42.225 --> 10:45.145
to develop a new cultural tourism.
What do you think? Is that impressive?

10:45.785 --> 10:48.625
Ms. Shang Zhitao,
you have become a bigwig.

10:48.705 --> 10:49.625
Yes.

10:51.625 --> 10:54.705
May your project
become a huge success soon.

10:54.785 --> 10:56.985
May your self-driving car

10:58.305 --> 11:00.105
go on the street soon.

11:01.145 --> 11:02.185
Okay.

11:06.025 --> 11:09.505
Sun Yuanzhu. This is such
a special mountain range.

11:10.785 --> 11:12.665
It's the spine of a dragon.

11:14.345 --> 11:15.425
A dragon spine?

11:35.145 --> 11:36.745
When I asked
to take on this distant project,

11:36.825 --> 11:38.265
some said it was beyond my capability.

11:38.345 --> 11:39.625
Some said I was trying
too hard to impress.

11:40.145 --> 11:43.105
But I know very well
that when I look down,

11:43.825 --> 11:45.745
it is to make sure
I am walking the right path.

11:46.785 --> 11:47.705
I'm so glad I'm here.

11:48.225 --> 11:50.745
NORTHWESTERN CHINA LAND LAW DRAFT

12:15.465 --> 12:17.745
SECTION EIGHT
PROPERTY OWNERSHIP RESOLUTION

12:18.385 --> 12:20.185
I used to think working

12:20.265 --> 12:22.425
was drinking with the right person
at a business dinner.

12:22.945 --> 12:24.265
But now I learned

12:24.785 --> 12:27.865
that the real battle
takes place where no one is around.

12:29.545 --> 12:31.905
THREE MONTHS LATER

12:36.185 --> 12:37.865
It represents our ideal.

12:40.505 --> 12:41.545
-Our idea…
-Flora.

12:41.625 --> 12:43.505
Mr. Luan has arrived. Come.

12:43.585 --> 12:44.465
Okay.

13:00.465 --> 13:02.025
-Flora.
-Lumi.

13:03.425 --> 13:04.745
I've missed you.

13:07.865 --> 13:08.865
Allow me to introduce.

13:10.385 --> 13:12.225
This is Flora, our project director
in Northwestern China.

13:12.945 --> 13:14.705
Flora. Our new colleague.

13:14.785 --> 13:15.665
Yilia.

13:16.265 --> 13:18.105
Flora. We finally meet.

13:18.185 --> 13:20.025
People have been
praising you at the office.

13:20.105 --> 13:21.065
I can't wait to learn from you.

13:21.145 --> 13:22.345
Likewise.

13:23.545 --> 13:25.665
It's about time. Come in.

13:33.185 --> 13:34.425
She's an elite who joined our division

13:34.505 --> 13:36.665
all the way
from the headquarters in the US.

13:37.185 --> 13:38.265
She bought her way in.

13:39.345 --> 13:41.545
Is this project that important?

13:41.625 --> 13:43.265
Even a bigwig like her is here.

13:44.185 --> 13:46.425
Of course, you have
an influential figure backing you up.

13:46.945 --> 13:48.865
Luke's presence is the greatest privilege
you can have.

13:49.705 --> 13:50.545
And I'm here too.

13:51.825 --> 13:52.785
Come.

13:53.505 --> 13:56.025
We like dragons. We deify dragons.

13:56.105 --> 13:58.065
Dragons are like our ideals.

13:58.145 --> 14:00.585
Our idea should incorporate
this kind of ideal.

14:00.665 --> 14:03.545
Instead of focusing on the landscape,

14:03.625 --> 14:07.665
we should highlight
the generations that live here.

14:07.745 --> 14:10.545
There are sculptures.
There is cultural heritage.

14:11.585 --> 14:14.825
So what exactly is Northwestern China?

14:24.105 --> 14:26.225
NORTHWESTERN CULTURAL TOURISM

14:26.305 --> 14:27.665
TARGET AUDIENCES
WELLNESS SEEKERS &amp; FAMILY TRAVELERS

14:27.745 --> 14:28.385
TRENDY YOUTH &amp; NICHE EXPLORERS

14:36.705 --> 14:37.905
PRIMARY PALETTE &amp; ITS IMPACT

14:54.465 --> 14:56.385
That's all for my presentation.

14:56.465 --> 14:57.705
Thank you for listening.

15:10.305 --> 15:11.905
Please proceed to the lounge next to us.

15:11.985 --> 15:14.065
We have prepared food and refreshments.

15:23.745 --> 15:25.505
I have taught Flora well.

15:25.585 --> 15:27.145
She made me proud.

15:28.425 --> 15:29.585
She's so good.

15:29.665 --> 15:32.905
She recognizes, values,
and manages talents very well.

15:32.985 --> 15:33.945
She can do everything.

15:34.745 --> 15:37.345
Flora is indeed exceptional in Lime.

15:38.265 --> 15:40.465
She started from a humble background.
She has a clear goal

15:41.065 --> 15:41.985
and works hard.

15:42.545 --> 15:45.265
Her amicability is also
one of a kind in Lime.

15:45.345 --> 15:48.265
Many colleagues remarked
that her passion and honesty

15:49.185 --> 15:50.665
were exemplary attributes.

15:51.625 --> 15:52.665
You're a smooth-talker today.

15:58.545 --> 15:59.865
Go eat first.

16:00.385 --> 16:01.625
I'll talk to Flora for a while.

16:02.505 --> 16:03.785
Come. Let's eat.

16:09.105 --> 16:10.105
NORTHWESTERN CULTURAL TOURISM
CONFERENCE HALL, BREAK ROOM

16:21.105 --> 16:22.385
Are you okay?

16:25.385 --> 16:26.425
It hurts.

16:36.705 --> 16:39.105
Stop moving around. Okay?

16:39.185 --> 16:40.145
Sit properly.

16:42.425 --> 16:43.785
You'll be fine soon.

16:46.265 --> 16:48.305
Am I going to die here?

16:48.385 --> 16:49.585
What are you on about?

16:50.105 --> 16:51.425
This is a good hospital.

16:51.505 --> 16:53.305
Besides, I'm here.

16:57.225 --> 16:58.185
Are you thirsty?

17:04.184 --> 17:07.944
The doctor said
you shouldn't drink soda anymore.

17:08.025 --> 17:11.065
Once we're back, I'll throw away
your cola and soda.

17:11.585 --> 17:12.505
Are you hungry?

17:16.184 --> 17:17.424
It's just a kidney stone.

17:18.065 --> 17:19.305
I'm fine.

17:21.224 --> 17:22.944
Just a kidney stone?

17:23.025 --> 17:24.825
You're the one suffering here.

17:36.385 --> 17:38.265
Does it not hurt anymore?
Why are you smiling?

17:41.025 --> 17:42.025
Lie down.

18:53.265 --> 18:54.545
Don't tell Lumi and the rest.

18:58.025 --> 18:59.105
Just tell them I went back to Beijing.

18:59.945 --> 19:01.225
You won't stay at the hotel?

19:03.345 --> 19:05.665
No. I'm staying with you.

19:07.665 --> 19:09.105
I need a carer.

19:41.425 --> 19:42.345
Yes.

19:42.425 --> 19:43.305
It's not out yet.

19:44.185 --> 19:46.145
I had an X-ray yesterday.
The doctor said it was moving out.

19:47.545 --> 19:49.305
It'll come out if I raise
my calves or climb stairs more often.

19:51.985 --> 19:53.225
Don't worry.

19:53.305 --> 19:54.345
Someone is looking after me.

19:56.425 --> 19:57.425
Who, you asked?

19:59.105 --> 19:59.945
My girlfriend.

20:01.945 --> 20:03.065
Your girlfriend?

20:03.825 --> 20:05.665
Can I speak to her?

20:06.265 --> 20:08.865
I need to talk to her
about your condition.

20:10.105 --> 20:12.745
Or maybe I should fly
to Northwestern China and drag you back?

20:12.825 --> 20:14.825
You want to speak to my girlfriend?

20:15.425 --> 20:16.425
Okay.

20:17.505 --> 20:18.345
It's my mom.

20:19.065 --> 20:20.225
She thinks I have a terminal illness.

20:24.545 --> 20:25.825
Hi, Dr. Liang.

20:26.425 --> 20:27.305
Hi.

20:27.945 --> 20:29.785
Miss, how should I address you?

20:29.865 --> 20:31.305
Just call me Flora.

20:32.185 --> 20:33.225
Flora.

20:33.305 --> 20:34.865
I just want to know
about Luan Nian's condition.

20:35.465 --> 20:37.465
Is it true that he has a kidney stone?

20:38.505 --> 20:40.665
Yes, he has a kidney stone.

20:40.745 --> 20:41.785
Don't worry about him.

20:41.865 --> 20:45.945
Luke has already told you
what he needed to do.

20:46.025 --> 20:48.145
I'll take him
to get his X-ray done in a few days.

20:48.665 --> 20:49.505
So don't worry about it.

20:50.465 --> 20:51.465
Okay.

20:52.545 --> 20:55.585
Flora. I know Luan Nian has a bad temper

20:55.665 --> 20:56.865
and he can be quite weird.

20:56.945 --> 20:58.665
-But don't--
-Anyway,

20:58.745 --> 21:01.305
as you already know, I'm not dead.
I'm hanging up now.

21:04.505 --> 21:06.385
Make sure to take your medicine.
I have to work now.

21:08.385 --> 21:09.905
When are you coming back?

21:11.505 --> 21:12.585
As soon as possible.

21:51.865 --> 21:53.745
Why are you lying on the couch?

21:54.505 --> 21:55.425
You're back.

22:01.505 --> 22:02.465
The mattress is too firm.

22:03.505 --> 22:05.745
The comforter is not soft enough.
And it's too thick.

22:06.345 --> 22:07.625
The pillow is too low.

22:09.105 --> 22:10.265
Are you a princess or what?

22:12.345 --> 22:14.025
You know what?
I'll get you a room in a hotel.

22:14.105 --> 22:15.665
But you won't stay
in the same hotel as Lumi.

22:15.745 --> 22:16.745
Is that okay?

22:17.865 --> 22:19.265
No.

22:19.345 --> 22:21.305
I just feel quite weak.

22:21.385 --> 22:22.385
It hurts everywhere.

22:24.025 --> 22:26.345
I'll just rest in the room. I'll lie down.

22:36.505 --> 22:38.025
Maybe you should return to Beijing.

22:38.545 --> 22:40.185
They have big hospitals there.

22:40.265 --> 22:41.705
You won't have to wait as long.

22:41.785 --> 22:42.985
I can't go back.

22:43.065 --> 22:44.465
Even getting out of bed
takes a lot of effort.

22:44.545 --> 22:45.785
I need time to recover.

22:47.625 --> 22:49.305
I bought a free-range chicken.

22:49.385 --> 22:50.665
Should I cook it for you?

22:55.385 --> 22:56.625
Are you sure I won't be poisoned?

22:58.025 --> 22:59.545
I can assure you
that it will be cooked thoroughly.

23:00.625 --> 23:03.585
You will do it an injustice
if it's not delicious enough.

23:08.305 --> 23:09.345
Let me cook.

23:11.705 --> 23:13.865
You… Aren't you sick?

23:15.825 --> 23:16.705
I can hang in there.

23:28.985 --> 23:29.945
Come. Drink some soup.

23:33.385 --> 23:34.425
Try it.

23:37.225 --> 23:38.425
I can do this myself.

23:39.385 --> 23:40.425
Just drink it.

23:48.385 --> 23:49.465
What do you think?

23:51.625 --> 23:52.945
It's good.

23:54.105 --> 23:55.545
I'll give you a shopping list tomorrow.

23:55.625 --> 23:57.225
Let's furnish the kitchen.

23:58.065 --> 24:01.105
You know I don't cook here.

24:03.585 --> 24:04.865
I can when I'm here.

24:12.265 --> 24:13.465
How long are you staying here?

24:15.025 --> 24:15.905
Until I recover.

24:26.585 --> 24:27.505
Does it still hurt?

24:31.105 --> 24:32.345
Occasionally.

24:34.305 --> 24:37.425
After you eat, do some calf raises.

25:23.625 --> 25:24.585
So?

25:24.665 --> 25:26.905
How is my performance as a househusband?

25:31.905 --> 25:33.185
Have you peed your kidney stone out?

25:37.145 --> 25:38.305
I don't know.

25:38.385 --> 25:39.745
But it doesn't hurt as much anymore.

25:43.505 --> 25:44.865
Then, return to Beijing tomorrow.

25:49.545 --> 25:50.705
I have taken a long leave.

26:00.745 --> 26:01.745
Shang Zhitao.

26:03.145 --> 26:04.385
You told me last time

26:04.465 --> 26:06.225
that you were young,
so you wanted to take the risk.

26:09.785 --> 26:11.025
Let's take another leap of faith.

26:31.345 --> 26:33.585
I don't want to take the old path.

26:38.625 --> 26:39.545
We are not doing that.

26:40.825 --> 26:42.185
I'll come with you.

26:43.825 --> 26:44.985
You can take me anywhere you want.

26:55.585 --> 26:56.465
Shang Zhitao.

26:57.185 --> 26:58.225
Luke has missed you a lot.

26:59.185 --> 27:03.025
Whenever we do a video call,
Luke just rushes to me

27:03.825 --> 27:05.105
whenever he hears you.

27:07.505 --> 27:09.065
He's more honest than I am.

27:10.105 --> 27:11.545
So, let me be honest with you.

27:12.905 --> 27:14.545
After we broke up,

27:15.185 --> 27:16.265
I felt awful.

27:17.465 --> 27:19.985
It's as if I've lost
something precious to me.

27:26.345 --> 27:28.025
I'm not good with words.

27:29.745 --> 27:30.785
But I know I miss you.

27:32.185 --> 27:33.105
I want to see you.

27:35.225 --> 27:36.705
I want to take a leap of faith with you.

27:39.465 --> 27:41.105
I want to see
if I can make it work between us.

27:44.305 --> 27:46.265
I have thought about our future.

27:49.225 --> 27:50.865
Can we start over again?

27:53.425 --> 27:54.265
Tao.

27:55.305 --> 27:57.025
Tell me. Do you not miss me?

28:21.065 --> 28:22.105
You're so annoying.

28:26.345 --> 28:27.225
You're so annoying.

28:28.785 --> 28:31.265
I have missed you so much.

28:48.745 --> 28:49.705
Shang Zhitao.

28:51.425 --> 28:52.305
Come back to Beijing with me.

28:57.985 --> 28:59.025
Come.

28:59.785 --> 29:00.945
Come back to Beijing with me.

29:05.225 --> 29:07.425
In what capacity
are you talking to me right now?

29:12.585 --> 29:13.905
If you're speaking as my boyfriend,

29:15.025 --> 29:18.585
I'll turn you down
because I like this project a lot.

29:19.305 --> 29:23.465
I want to see it through,
and I hope you'll respect my choice.

29:26.225 --> 29:28.505
If you're speaking as my boss,

29:30.545 --> 29:33.105
then I'll come back.
Because you're my boss.

29:34.705 --> 29:36.665
But I think it's a shame.

29:37.385 --> 29:39.105
I don't know

29:39.185 --> 29:41.665
if I'll ever have
a similar opportunity again in the future.

29:41.745 --> 29:44.745
This is the only shot
that will most likely change my life.

30:06.865 --> 30:08.305
Let's travel together.

30:09.025 --> 30:10.185
Where to?

30:11.385 --> 30:13.545
We'll bring the dog with us
and go wherever we want.

30:30.385 --> 30:31.985
Where are we going next?

30:34.145 --> 30:34.985
To Tibet, China.

30:36.665 --> 30:37.545
Tibet, China?

30:39.865 --> 30:41.305
What if I have altitude sickness?

30:42.745 --> 30:44.105
We have oxygen bottles.

30:44.705 --> 30:47.865
If I have altitude sickness,
will you look after me?

30:47.945 --> 30:49.145
If you have altitude sickness,

30:50.665 --> 30:52.225
I'll sell you off.

31:00.225 --> 31:01.905
-It's dangerous.
-Come here.

31:09.025 --> 31:10.105
Why are you staring at me?

31:13.185 --> 31:17.145
You are so gentle today.

31:19.585 --> 31:20.945
Have I ever hit you?

31:21.025 --> 31:22.265
No.

31:23.425 --> 31:25.145
I just wish you could be

31:26.505 --> 31:28.305
this gentle with me more often.

31:31.905 --> 31:33.225
So you like someone who's soft.

31:34.665 --> 31:35.825
Luan Nian.

31:35.905 --> 31:37.105
Do you know?

31:37.185 --> 31:38.905
I think you should know this.

31:39.905 --> 31:41.145
What?

31:42.105 --> 31:44.065
I love to travel with you.

31:46.185 --> 31:47.385
That's all?

31:47.905 --> 31:49.625
Anything you want to add?

31:58.265 --> 31:59.225
Luan Nian.

32:01.385 --> 32:03.465
I love every path you take.

32:06.145 --> 32:07.625
I love to go on an adventure with you.

32:10.785 --> 32:12.465
I love the landscape on this journey.

32:13.625 --> 32:15.465
Because we're doing it together.

32:52.305 --> 32:54.465
MOM

32:54.545 --> 32:56.825
-It's my mom.
-Pick it up.

32:58.785 --> 32:59.665
Mom.

32:59.745 --> 33:02.785
Why didn't you go on the trip
with Song Qiuhan and the rest?

33:03.825 --> 33:05.625
I changed my mind. I have a road trip now.

33:06.345 --> 33:07.385
A road trip?

33:08.585 --> 33:09.465
With Flora?

33:10.465 --> 33:11.745
You sure have a good memory.

33:12.585 --> 33:13.785
I'm driving. I'll call you back

33:13.865 --> 33:16.905
-when we take a break in the city.
-No need.

33:16.985 --> 33:18.825
You're having fun right now.

33:18.905 --> 33:20.105
No need to call me.

33:20.185 --> 33:23.065
Just text me to tell me you're safe.

33:24.465 --> 33:25.585
Flora.

33:27.025 --> 33:28.385
Yes, Dr. Liang?

33:28.465 --> 33:30.105
Luan Nian has a bad temper.

33:30.705 --> 33:33.225
And he can be quite weird.
Thank you for putting up with him.

33:33.305 --> 33:35.585
But don't take it lying down.

33:35.665 --> 33:37.425
-If he does something wrong, you--
-Anyway.

33:37.505 --> 33:40.265
I have a good temper. And I am not weird.

33:40.945 --> 33:41.945
Bye.

33:46.025 --> 33:47.505
Not weird, you said?

33:53.025 --> 33:55.745
I think our son is in love.

33:55.825 --> 33:58.825
And I think he really loves her.

34:01.585 --> 34:03.545
It's just a trip. How is it real?

34:04.065 --> 34:06.665
He was with Zang Yao for a decade.
Did he fall in love with her?

34:08.264 --> 34:09.505
Honestly,

34:09.585 --> 34:13.264
businessmen like you
only know how to do business.

34:14.264 --> 34:16.505
Has he ever gone out with Zang Yao alone?

34:17.625 --> 34:18.824
Also,

34:18.905 --> 34:22.465
Luan Nian even admitted
that she was his girlfriend.

34:22.545 --> 34:23.425
Has he ever done that?

34:24.824 --> 34:28.025
You are just too eager
to be a grandmother.

34:29.065 --> 34:30.185
Listen.

34:30.264 --> 34:31.705
Don't be too eager.

34:32.225 --> 34:34.545
Don't get your hopes up

34:34.625 --> 34:36.585
because Luan Nian
has always been like this.

34:36.665 --> 34:39.705
-He will mess things up.
-And he got that from you.

34:41.264 --> 34:42.705
If only he were more like me.

35:42.465 --> 35:43.705
Do you want to take photos?

35:43.785 --> 35:44.785
You can pick your costumes inside.

35:45.505 --> 35:46.625
Let me see.

35:51.425 --> 35:54.665
Luan Nian. Do you like the photos here?

35:55.225 --> 35:56.065
I do.

35:56.585 --> 35:57.785
But I won't take them.

36:01.265 --> 36:02.305
Sir.

36:02.385 --> 36:04.025
Do you… Do you have a model here?

36:04.905 --> 36:07.425
A male model
to take a couple of photos with me.

36:08.065 --> 36:09.465
Yes.

36:09.545 --> 36:10.985
You just have to pay extra.

36:11.065 --> 36:12.305
Let me show you.

36:12.385 --> 36:13.705
Young Tibetan men.

36:13.785 --> 36:15.185
-Really?
-They are very handsome.

36:15.265 --> 36:17.025
I want a handsome one

36:17.105 --> 36:18.785
-to take photos, like--
-Shang Zhitao.

36:24.345 --> 36:25.345
Which one do you want?

36:28.065 --> 36:28.985
You pick one first.

36:49.945 --> 36:51.265
Okay. Great.

36:52.105 --> 36:53.265
Stay.

36:53.345 --> 36:54.345
Hold it higher.

36:54.425 --> 36:56.545
Yes! Great. This is good.

36:59.305 --> 37:00.785
Two more single photos.

37:02.625 --> 37:04.065
Your husband can join now.

37:14.145 --> 37:16.185
-Stand here?
-Yes.

37:20.865 --> 37:22.465
Stand closer to your wife.

37:26.345 --> 37:29.145
Yes. Hug your wife.

37:31.865 --> 37:32.705
Yes.

37:34.105 --> 37:36.305
Don't be so stiff, you two.

37:36.385 --> 37:38.345
Just relax.

37:39.785 --> 37:42.225
Too stiff. Aren't you always
soft and relaxed?

37:47.745 --> 37:50.025
Wonderful. Good.

37:50.705 --> 37:53.305
Closer. Yes!

38:10.665 --> 38:12.985
Good. Let's pick your photos here.

38:23.585 --> 38:24.625
Come here already.

38:30.305 --> 38:31.545
So gentle.

38:31.625 --> 38:33.385
Is this the Luan Nian I know?

38:34.625 --> 38:37.625
It feels like
we're dating for real this time.

38:53.705 --> 38:54.585
Eat now, Luke.

38:57.345 --> 38:59.665
He's so fat now. Stop feeding him.

38:59.745 --> 39:00.585
Drink some water.

39:02.305 --> 39:03.385
Thanks.

39:12.585 --> 39:16.625
I appreciate that you never
threw tantrums at me.

39:16.705 --> 39:19.825
You didn't leave me behind on the streets.

39:19.905 --> 39:20.865
Congratulations.

39:20.945 --> 39:24.105
You have become someone I trust.

39:26.265 --> 39:28.865
-That's my honor.
-Of course.

39:37.265 --> 39:40.425
-Mom.
-How is Tibet, China?

39:40.505 --> 39:41.985
I love it here.

39:42.065 --> 39:44.465
I eat well. I sleep well.

39:44.545 --> 39:45.625
The scenery here is beautiful.

39:46.545 --> 39:47.625
Luke is happy too.

39:50.825 --> 39:52.305
Who are you traveling with?

39:52.385 --> 39:53.905
Your boyfriend?

39:56.545 --> 39:58.505
Yes. My boyfriend.

40:02.145 --> 40:04.065
When did this happen?

40:04.145 --> 40:05.865
-Who is he?
-Yes. Who?

40:05.945 --> 40:07.225
How is his family?

40:07.305 --> 40:09.105
How are his parents?

40:09.185 --> 40:10.185
Is he kind?

40:10.985 --> 40:12.865
Hi, Mrs. Shang. I am Luan Nian.

40:18.065 --> 40:22.705
Hi. We are on the phone
together with Tao's dad.

40:22.785 --> 40:24.345
-You are Mr. Luan, right?
-Give me that.

40:24.425 --> 40:25.305
Yes, Mrs. Shang.

40:25.385 --> 40:27.065
Tao and I have been dating for six years.

40:29.345 --> 40:30.425
My family is okay.

40:30.505 --> 40:31.585
-My annual income is--
-Enough.

40:32.865 --> 40:34.265
Mom. I…

40:34.345 --> 40:36.185
I'll talk to you later. Bye.

40:37.505 --> 40:38.585
He hasn't even finished.

40:41.825 --> 40:43.265
Why are you scared?

40:43.345 --> 40:44.225
Too ashamed to tell anyone?

40:44.305 --> 40:45.785
No.

40:45.865 --> 40:47.465
I just…

40:51.265 --> 40:52.225
Yes?

41:04.385 --> 41:05.665
Luan Nian.

41:11.585 --> 41:12.505
What?

41:33.465 --> 41:34.545
Luke is here.

41:38.545 --> 41:40.185
And you have altitude sickness. Be nice.

41:46.985 --> 41:48.905
I think I'm fine.

41:48.985 --> 41:50.145
I don't have altitude sickness.

41:50.225 --> 41:51.625
Right.

41:53.145 --> 41:55.545
Smooth your breathing first.

41:56.745 --> 41:59.185
If something happens to you,
I'll have to collect your body.

42:01.465 --> 42:03.425
Then, can we talk?

42:05.625 --> 42:06.465
About what?

42:09.465 --> 42:10.865
Let's talk

42:11.785 --> 42:13.465
about the first time we met.

42:15.865 --> 42:17.385
The first time we met?

42:19.345 --> 42:20.185
In the office?

42:20.985 --> 42:22.585
No.

42:22.665 --> 42:23.585
You don't remember?

42:23.665 --> 42:24.865
Where was it then?

42:24.945 --> 42:26.225
In the hall.

42:27.025 --> 42:31.665
I was like, how could someone
be this handsome?

42:31.745 --> 42:33.825
You're the most handsome man I've met.

42:34.425 --> 42:35.785
Your turn now.

42:35.865 --> 42:36.785
Tell me.

42:38.105 --> 42:41.905
When I first met you, I was thinking,
how could someone be this dumb?

42:44.665 --> 42:46.545
Like a big dummy.

42:50.145 --> 42:51.065
I'm tired now.

42:52.865 --> 42:54.265
-Mad?
-No.

42:54.345 --> 42:55.345
I'm just sleepy.

42:57.025 --> 42:58.025
Shang Zhitao.

42:59.865 --> 43:01.345
Should we catch the aurora next year?

43:04.745 --> 43:06.065
I'll go

43:07.305 --> 43:08.945
wherever you go.

43:18.665 --> 43:22.345
This year is a good year.

43:40.145 --> 43:41.305
I love this photo.

43:42.505 --> 43:43.905
This one too.

43:45.305 --> 43:46.545
This one is good.

43:46.625 --> 43:49.945
This one is good.
You're a good photographer.

43:50.825 --> 43:51.785
Thank you.

43:51.865 --> 43:53.185
I want all of them.

43:53.265 --> 43:54.385
We'll take everything then.

43:54.465 --> 43:55.545
How much more should we pay?

43:56.265 --> 43:57.265
No need to pay extra.

43:57.345 --> 43:59.665
Can I hang one in my shop?

43:59.745 --> 44:00.945
Then, you'll have to pay us.

44:05.305 --> 44:06.625
Pick one

44:06.705 --> 44:08.145
and hang it
at the most visible place in the shop.

44:08.225 --> 44:09.825
Process it with the best film.

44:09.905 --> 44:11.105
Once you're done, I'll inspect it.

44:11.185 --> 44:13.145
Sure. No problem.

44:13.225 --> 44:14.745
I'll give you the original film.

44:14.825 --> 44:17.345
After I process it,
you can pick two as your wedding photos.

44:18.305 --> 44:19.625
It'll last for many years.

44:20.185 --> 44:22.625
The Tibetans use this
for their wedding photos.

44:24.225 --> 44:26.905
I highly doubt I can get
good photos like this again.

44:27.745 --> 44:28.705
Of course.

44:31.905 --> 44:33.425
I'll count on you
to process the films, then.

44:33.505 --> 44:34.505
Sure. Don't worry.

44:35.545 --> 44:36.465
Luan Nian.
